\title{Supervised and preference post-training}
\tag{ftip}
\tag{post-training}

\p{Pretraining supplies a conditional language model. Post-training changes
that model with task-facing records. This section separates demonstrations,
preferences, rewards, and regularization before turning to reinforcement
learning.}

